{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch through the cosmos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lobstar: Arcade Version</i> is a shoot-em-up where you cannot shoot bullets. Instead, you can punch those bullets back at foes--or get in the enemy's face and punch them yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659140/extras/4bbf48792dc01c53b5824b00ad3d3ef1.poster.avif?t=1754247284\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659140/extras/4bbf48792dc01c53b5824b00ad3d3ef1.webm?t=1754247284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659140/extras/4bbf48792dc01c53b5824b00ad3d3ef1.mp4?t=1754247284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659140/extras/8a8dfe7b70570e1c90690b9e388c6435.webp?t=1754247284\" width=612 height=40 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punch Past it All!</strong> Punch bullets\u00a0to deflect\u00a0them.\u00a0They will\u00a0automatically fly at the\u00a0nearest\u00a0enemy. You can also defeat most\u00a0enemies in\u00a0one punch!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shine Bright with Star Time: </strong>Perform a <strong>Lobster Roll </strong>to evade an attack with good timing to enable\u00a0<strong>Star\u00a0Time</strong>. You cannot take damage during Star Time, so go crazy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lobstars Never Die: </strong>Cosmic lobster &quot;The Lobstar&quot; is immortal and cannot die. Getting hit\u00a0will push it\u00a0back,\u00a0but this will not deter it from\u00a0its\u00a0destination. While anyone can clear the game,  the credits won't roll for just anyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot for the Stars: </strong>Go for\u00a0a\u00a0high score or\u00a0a\u00a0fast\u00a0clear\u00a0time with the in-game ranking and timer functions! Crazy-quick crustaceans may even catch up with the edge of the universe itself...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659140/extras/bb7e2c6c5aa58db19ac67f02a3b48f92.poster.avif?t=1754247284\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659140/extras/bb7e2c6c5aa58db19ac67f02a3b48f92.webm?t=1754247284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659140/extras/bb7e2c6c5aa58db19ac67f02a3b48f92.mp4?t=1754247284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3659140?t=1754247284","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659140/623699300b1daa71b0da9ed31d9e0d6e734a1cca/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754247284","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659140/e9692dfee8c0977f519cbd7647488bf8f877b730/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754247284","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659140/e9692dfee8c0977f519cbd7647488bf8f877b730/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754247284","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch through the cosmos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lobstar: Arcade Version</i> is a shoot-em-up where you cannot shoot bullets. Instead, you can punch 